59	// "Partition" is the retention bucket we cap at 10 MiB:
60	// - one bucket per non-null thread_id
61	// - one bucket per threadless (thread_id IS NULL) non-null process_uuid
62	// - one bucket for threadless rows with process_uuid IS NULL
